# The agent workspace is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT.
# Everything is ignored unless explicitly whitelisted below — so personal
# content (documents, logs, archives) can never end up on GitHub.
#
# Tracked = the shippable agent scaffold (CLAUDE.md, templates/, folder
# READMEs). Private = everything the agent and user create from it.
*

# --- Tracked structure & templates -----------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!.mcp.json

!templates/
!templates/**

!documents/
documents/*
!documents/README.md

!logs/
logs/*
!logs/README.md

!archive/
archive/*
!archive/README.md
